            "name": "rollup_note",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### Reading the rollup\n`overall_status` is worst-of the three families. **Performance reads `UNKNOWN` on the most recent windows by design** — fraud labels arrive with chargebacks and investigations, days to weeks late. A missing window would read as \"fine\"; `UNKNOWN` reads as \"not yet knowable\".\n\nDrift red + performance unknown is *investigate*, not *retrain*."
              ]
